 lcutmx(atom) = maximum l-cutoff for the product basis.  =4 is required for atoms with valence d, like Ni Ga
  4
  atom   l  nnvv  nnc ! nnvv: num. of radial functions (valence) on the augmentation-waves, nnc: num. for core.
    1    0    2    3
    1    1    3    1
    1    2    2    0
    1    3    2    0
