    1    1    1    1    1   ! 4p_phi   
    1    1    2    0    0   ! 4p_phidot
    1    1    3    1    0   ! 3p_phiz  
    1    2    1    1    1   ! 3d_phi   
    1    2    2    0    0   ! 3d_phidot
    1    3    1    0    1   ! 4f_phi   
    1    3    2    0    0   ! 4f_phidot
    1    4    1    0    0   ! 5g_phi   
    1    4    2    0    0   ! 5g_phidot
  atom   l    n  occ unocc  ForX0 ForSxc ! Core (1=yes, 0=no)
    1    0    1    0    0      0    0    ! 1S -----
    1    0    2    0    0      0    0    ! 2S
    1    0    3    0    0      0    0    ! 3S
